WEBVTT

00:00:00.647 --> 00:00:04.646
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> The ball <b>went over</b> the goalkeeper’s head and <b>into</b> the goal.

00:00:06.585 --> 00:00:09.898
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> He <b>drove out of</b> the car park and <b>along</b> the street.

00:00:11.841 --> 00:00:15.279
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> I <b>ran over</b> the bridge and <b>across</b> the park.